----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
WHY THIS IS THE DEVICE AND NOT RAM  (device-signature control)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  s0/s1 read the SAME address twice and returned 0x5a then 0xa5.
  A memory cell returns the last value written to BOTH reads (a5,a5).
  Push order (5a,a5) can only come from a FIFO -- the wdc inbuf ring.
  And row D returned 0xc0, the poisoned CD image byte at offset 0,
  so the ring demonstrably holds real DISK data, not device scratch.

ADDTOINBUF_RUNG3_DONE
